<Base title="Business technology support in Arizona | HourlyTechs" description="Remote IT and software support for Arizona small businesses, without a full-time IT hire."><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><h1>Business technology support</h1><p class="lead">Remote IT and software support for Arizona small businesses, without a full-time IT hire.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=Business%20software">Request tech help</a><a class="plain" href="/#pricing">Compare rates</a></div></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1726649339368-28dacc581266?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1100&amp;q=82" alt="Professional working at a desk" width="1100" height="760" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-photo-rate">$48/hr business software · $72/hr advanced IT (scheduled)<small>Billed by the minute · subject to availability</small></div></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>What we can help with</h2><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><LayoutGrid size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Microsoft 365</h3><p>Help with Outlook, Teams, shared files, user settings and everyday Office applications.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Cloud size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Google Workspace</h3><p>Troubleshoot Gmail, Drive, shared calendars, permissions and collaboration settings.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Sheet size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Business applications</h3><p>Investigate software errors, spreadsheet problems, integrations and configuration issues.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Globe size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Domains & email delivery</h3><p>Help diagnose DNS records, domain configuration and SPF, DKIM and DMARC settings.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Monitor size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Websites & hosting</h3><p>Investigate common website errors, hosting settings and publishing problems.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Server size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Advanced IT</h3><p>Assess cloud access, network configuration and more complex technical issues before agreeing on the scope.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="block pricing"><div class="wrap"><h2>How remote help works</h2><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Describe the issue</h3><p>Tell us what you are trying to accomplish, what device or software you use and what has gone wrong.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Agree on a plan</h3><p>Confirm the appropriate specialty, rate and scope before starting a session.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Work with a technician</h3><p>Follow guided steps or approve remote access when appropriate, and review the outcome together.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><h3>Do we need a monthly contract?</h3><p>Our pay-as-you-go pricing is agreed before each session.</p></article><article class="service"><h3>Can you replace our managed IT provider?</h3><p>Hourly support is intended for defined tasks, not continuous monitoring, incident response or guaranteed uptime.</p></article><article class="service"><h3>Can you work with sensitive business data?</h3><p>Access requirements must be agreed first. Do not share regulated or confidential data until appropriate safeguards are established.</p></article></div><div class="actions"><a class="plain" href="/#services">Other services</a></div></div></section></Base>